 <div style={{ width: 56, height: 56, borderRadius: "var(--ids-radius-lg)", background: "var(--ids-warning-bg)", display: "flex", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "center", fontSize: 24 }}>📡</div>
 <div style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 700, color: "var(--ids-text-primary)" }}>Demand Forecasting Unavailable</div>
 <div style={{ fontSize: 14, color: "var(--ids-text-secondary)", maxWidth: 480, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
 Demand forecasting data is currently unavailable. The external demand forecast API is not connected.
 Please contact your account manager for availability timelines.
